{"page":198,"verses":[{"verse_key":"9:69","surah":9,"ayah":69,"ar_uthmani":"كَٱلَّذِينَ مِن قَبْلِكُمْ كَانُوٓا۟ أَشَدَّ مِنكُمْ قُوَّةً وَأَكْثَرَ أَمْوَٰلًا وَأَوْلَـٰدًا فَٱسْتَمْتَعُوا۟ بِخَلَـٰقِهِمْ فَٱسْتَمْتَعْتُم بِخَلَـٰقِكُمْ كَمَا ٱسْتَمْتَعَ ٱلَّذِينَ مِن قَبْلِكُم بِخَلَـٰقِهِمْ وَخُضْتُمْ كَٱلَّذِى خَاضُوٓا۟ ۚ أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ حَبِطَتْ أَعْمَـٰلُهُمْ فِى ٱلدُّنْيَا وَٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ ۖ وَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ هُمُ ٱلْخَـٰسِرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"‘You are like those who lived before you: they were even stronger than you, with more wealth and children; they enjoyed their share in this life as you have enjoyed yours; like them, you have indulged in idle talk.’ Their deeds go to waste in this world and the next; it is they who will lose all in the life to come.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"كَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"Like those","transliteration":"ka-alladhīna","verse_key":"9:69"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"before you","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"9:69"},{"pos":3,"ar":"قَبْلِكُمْ","en_gloss":"before you","transliteration":"qablikum","verse_key":"9:69"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كَانُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"they were","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"9:69"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَشَدَّ","en_gloss":"mightier","transliteration":"ashadda","verse_key":"9:69"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِنكُمْ","en_gloss":"than you","transliteration":"minkum","verse_key":"9:69"},{"pos":7,"ar":"قُوَّةًۭ","en_gloss":"(in) strength","transliteration":"quwwatan","verse_key":"9:69"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَأَكْثَرَ","en_gloss":"and more abundant","transliteration":"wa-akthara","verse_key":"9:69"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَمْوَٰلًۭا","en_gloss":"(in) wealth","transliteration":"amwālan","verse_key":"9:69"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَأَوْلَـٰدًۭا","en_gloss":"and children","transliteration":"wa-awlādan","verse_key":"9:69"},{"pos":11,"ar":"فَٱسْتَمْتَعُوا۟","en_gloss":"So they enjoyed","transliteration":"fa-is'tamtaʿū","verse_key":"9:69"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بِخَلَـٰقِهِمْ","en_gloss":"their portion","transliteration":"bikhalāqihim","vers