gloss":"(are) the losers","transliteration":"l-khāsirūna","verse_key":"9:69"},{"pos":33,"ar":"٦٩","en_gloss":"(69)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:69"}]},{"verse_key":"9:70","surah":9,"ayah":70,"ar_uthmani":"أَلَمْ يَأْتِهِمْ نَبَأُ ٱلَّذِينَ مِن قَبْلِهِمْ قَوْمِ نُوحٍ وَعَادٍ وَثَمُودَ وَقَوْمِ إِبْرَٰهِيمَ وَأَصْحَـٰبِ مَدْيَنَ وَٱلْمُؤْتَفِكَـٰتِ ۚ أَتَتْهُمْ رُسُلُهُم بِٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ ۖ فَمَا كَانَ ٱللَّهُ لِيَظْلِمَهُمْ وَلَـٰكِن كَانُوٓا۟ أَنفُسَهُمْ يَظْلِمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Have they never heard the stories about their predecessors, the peoples of Noah, Ad, Thamud, Abraham, Midian, and the ruined cities? Their messengers came to them with clear evidence of the truth: God would not deceive them; they deceived themselves.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَلَمْ","en_gloss":"Has not","transliteration":"alam","verse_key":"9:70"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَأْتِهِمْ","en_gloss":"come to them","transliteration":"yatihim","verse_key":"9:70"},{"pos":3,"ar":"نَبَأُ","en_gloss":"(the) news","transliteration":"naba-u","verse_key":"9:70"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"(of) those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"9:70"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"(were) before them","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"9:70"},{"pos":6,"ar":"قَبْلِهِمْ","en_gloss":"(were) before them","transliteration":"qablihim","verse_key":"9:70"},{"pos":7,"ar":"قَوْمِ","en_gloss":"(the) people","transliteration":"qawmi","verse_key":"9:70"},{"pos":8,"ar":"نُوحٍۢ","en_gloss":"(of) Nuh","transliteration":"nūḥin","verse_key":"9:70"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَعَادٍۢ","en_gloss":"and Aad","transliteration":"waʿādin","verse_key":"9:70"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَثَمُودَ","en_gloss":"and Thamud","transliteration":"wathamūda","verse_key":"9:70"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَقَوْمِ","en_gloss":"and (the) people","transliteration":"waqawmi","verse_key":"9:70"},{"pos":12,"ar":"إِبْرَٰهِيمَ","en_gloss":"(of) Ibrahim","transliteration":"ib'rāhīma","verse_key":"9:70"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَأَصْحَـٰبِ","en_gloss":"and (