 alms; they obey God and His Messenger. God will give His mercy to such people: God is almighty and wise.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ","en_gloss":"And the believing men","transliteration":"wal-mu'minūna","verse_key":"9:71"},{"pos":2,"ar":"وَٱلْمُؤْمِنَـٰتُ","en_gloss":"and the believing women","transliteration":"wal-mu'minātu","verse_key":"9:71"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بَعْضُهُمْ","en_gloss":"some of them","transliteration":"baʿḍuhum","verse_key":"9:71"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَوْلِيَآءُ","en_gloss":"(are) allies","transliteration":"awliyāu","verse_key":"9:71"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بَعْضٍۢ ۚ","en_gloss":"(of) others","transliteration":"baʿḍin","verse_key":"9:71"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَأْمُرُونَ","en_gloss":"They enjoin","transliteration":"yamurūna","verse_key":"9:71"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِٱلْمَعْرُوفِ","en_gloss":"the right","transliteration":"bil-maʿrūfi","verse_key":"9:71"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَيَنْهَوْنَ","en_gloss":"and forbid","transliteration":"wayanhawna","verse_key":"9:71"},{"pos":9,"ar":"عَنِ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"ʿani","verse_key":"9:71"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْمُنكَرِ","en_gloss":"the wrong","transliteration":"l-munkari","verse_key":"9:71"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَيُقِيمُونَ","en_gloss":"and they establish","transliteration":"wayuqīmūna","verse_key":"9:71"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","en_gloss":"the prayer","transliteration":"l-ṣalata","verse_key":"9:71"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَيُؤْتُونَ","en_gloss":"and give","transliteration":"wayu'tūna","verse_key":"9:71"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلزَّكَوٰةَ","en_gloss":"the zakah","transliteration":"l-zakata","verse_key":"9:71"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَيُطِيعُونَ","en_gloss":"and they obey","transliteration":"wayuṭīʿūna","verse_key":"9:71"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"9:71"},{"pos":17,"ar":"وَرَسُولَهُۥٓ ۚ","en_gloss":"and His Messenger","transliteration":"warasūlahu","verse_key":"9:71"},{"pos":18,"ar":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"Those","transliteration":"ulāika","verse_key":"9:71"},{"pos":19